        <mxCell id="WktI_tupJLWSP2hLV0lz-40" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. OpCodes are decoding on INSTR0..INSTR4, those should be converted to 74HC688 and 684&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Green arrows are served by the existing backplane - not part of the problem&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Green boxes are complete n terms of input/output pins&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Backplane baseline includes: Clock, reset, WE#, OE#, Address, Data, Control (24 lines), Opcode/lower Instruction (8 lines)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
